  "2026-08-26T21:27:34.094Z","harness:codex","GitHub intake: GH-1125 https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1125. Complete all-status census found this closed item as the canonical unknown-help owner; no duplicate created. Red reproduction: pm learn --help exits 2 with the correct did-you-mean on stderr but also emits full root help on stdout, making the probe look successful to stdout-only consumers."
  "2026-08-26T21:34:26.337Z","harness:codex","TDD red: real-runtime unknown-help regression now asserts stdout never contains root usage; arbitrary, link, and learn probes still leak the root help before the structured usage error."
  "2026-08-26T22:51:36.963Z","harness:codex","Evidence: unknown help paths now enter the structured Commander error boundary without rendering root usage first. Fresh-directory pm learn --help exited 2, wrote 0 stdout bytes, and emitted the learnings suggestion and recovery bundle on stderr; linked sandbox-safe suites passed 1/1 and 132/132. Repository gates passed pnpm build, pnpm lint, zero jscpd clones, 584 files and 8025 tests with exact 100/100/100/100 coverage, pnpm audit clean, and Trivy HIGH/CRITICAL vuln+secret+misconfig clean."
